<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 67.6999 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 67.6999 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 67.6999 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 67.5689 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Aug 26		  Aug 23</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     67.6999		 67.5689</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	    5.780		   6.180</p>
<p>				    Aug 26		  Aug 19</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.8500		 45.5750</p>
<p> volume (DM million)	   0.060		   0.010</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
